  - title: A little jar of dirt
    number: 2
    heartsNeeded: 2
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Could I take a soil sample from your farm? A tiny one. A jar. A small jar. With a label.
    - Every farm's soil is different, like a fingerprint. Yours is older than the whole suburb. It's probably full of stories. And worms. Mostly worms.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
      questText: 
      reminder: []
      thanks: []
    choice:
      enabled: 0
