      friendship: 0
  - title: Roots
    number: 3
    heartsNeeded: 3
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - My thesis is about roots. How they find water, how they share food, how they decide where to go. Plants make decisions! Slowly, but they do.
    - Could you bring me some potatoes from your farm? Three. I want to look at the skins under the microscope. I promise I'll eat them afterwards.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fc0104c92e9c5554aa4867f63b6c5cbe, type: 2}
      amount: 3
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: Potatoes for the microscope
      questText: Bea wants three potatoes from your farm to study under her microscope for her thesis.
      reminder:
      - Any potatoes? Three, please. I've already labelled the slides. 'Farm potato one', 'farm potato two', 'farm potato three'. I'm very organised.
      thanks:
      - Oh, look at the eyes on this one! That's where the new shoots come from. They're called eyes. Isn't that lovely?
      - 'Here. A thank-you. Lab rules: always pay your farmer.'
    choice:
      enabled: 0
      optionA: 
      replyA: []
      flagsA: []
      optionB: 
      replyB: []
      flagsB: []
    setFlags: []
    reward:
      gold: 100
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      friendship: 0
  - title: The seed rack
    number: 4
    heartsNeeded: 4
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags:
      - story_daughter_5
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - I went to the general store on Tuesday to buy one packet of seeds.
    - I came home three hours later with one packet of seeds. Soo-ah knows the germination rate of every packet on that rack. By heart.
    - We're meeting again on Thursday. To talk about seeds. Purely seeds. Why are you smiling like that?
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
      questText: 
